OL,3,GNEWSATram strike to coincide with
OL,4,ANottingham's Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram staff are to go on strike during
OL,7,FNottingham's historic Goose Fair, it
OL,8,Fhas been confirmed.
OL,10,FThe city's tram operator Nottingham
OL,11,FExpress Transit (NET) said on Wednesday
OL,12,Fthe move followed nine months of pay
OL,13,Fdiscussions and negotiations, including
OL,14,Fa pay offer in June that was rejected
OL,15,Fby the union GMB.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
