OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSATram strike to coincide with
OL,4,ANottingham's Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndustrial action is due to take place
OL,7,Facross six days during a two-week
OL,8,Fperiod beginning on Saturday 26
OL,9,FSeptember - a day after the annual
OL,10,Fevent at Forest Recreation Ground gets
OL,11,Funder way, as well as the Robin Hood
OL,12,Fhalf marathon on Sunday.
OL,14,FColin Whyatt, the regional organiser
OL,15,Ffor GMB, said members were "awfully
OL,16,Fsupportive", with 88% of them voting
OL,17,Ffor strike action.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
